WEBVTT

00:11:30.863 --> 00:11:32.530
“Apanya yang bagaimana?”

00:11:33.030 --> 00:11:34.497
“Kanker.

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:36.430
Bagaimana rasanya kanker ibu?”

00:11:38.963 --> 00:11:41.297
“Panas,” kata ibu saya

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:47.430
“Tulang ibu terbakar
dan semuanya di bawah kulit ibu terbakar.

00:11:47.463 --> 00:11:50.463
Dan setiap ibu bergerak,
sakitnya semakin parah.

00:11:50.463 --> 00:11:52.563
Sekujur tubuh ibu seperti terbakar.”

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.297
Setelah beberapa saat,

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:00.663
ibu saya berkata,
“Kamu marah ya sama ibu?”